WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:02.612
- One of these has gotta be dog food.

00:00:04.582 --> 00:00:06.562
- They all look like earthquake food.

00:00:06.562 --> 00:00:08.322
- I spin the cans and when it lands

00:00:08.322 --> 00:00:09.902
on the red on, I eat that?

00:00:09.902 --> 00:00:11.322
- Oh no.

00:00:11.322 --> 00:00:13.162
(laughing)

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:15.032
(cans crashing)

00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:18.052
- Corn, peas, corn.

00:00:20.182 --> 00:00:21.880
- Oh, I don't want any of the small ones.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.140
- Oh shit, the small one.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.680
- It sounds gelatinous.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:29.830
- Best by September 2018, so we're good.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.200
- Oh god.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.880
- You didn't tell me (laughing).

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.020
- I think it's dog food.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.020
- Ew, I hear it.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.790
- I'm so nervous.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.920
- I don't think I like that.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.040
- Doesn't smell that
bad; it could be corn.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.570
- There you are.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:45.081
- No.

00:00:45.081 --> 00:00:46.880
- Ew, ew, what is that?

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.060
- It's not hot dogs.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.920
- It's some sort of animal food.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.750
- It's not corn.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.280
- Peaches.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.350
- I don't want anymore.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:56.650
- I have to eat the whole thing?

00:00:56.650 --> 00:00:58.038
- No, I can't do that.

00:00:58.038 --> 00:01:00.178
- No, I don't; I'm lactose intolerant.

00:01:00.178 --> 00:01:02.448
I'm not eating the whole
can of condensed milk.

00:01:02.448 --> 00:01:05.008
- How weird; what a mindfuck.

